  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Acetic acid in benzene undergoes dimerization<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi><mo>&#8652;</mo><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>due to which Von&#39;t hoff factor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>Theoretical&#160;molar&#160;mass</mtext><mtext>Experimental&#160;molar&#160;mass</mtext></mfrac></math></p>",
